Adaptive Servo Logic

The servo logic also includes:

Dynamic compensation: adjusts servo speed based on air resistance.

Angle-rate limiting: prevents mechanical stress on servo gear.

Fail-safe mode: freezes servo position in case of signal loss or power fluctuation.


